			(fields
				(field
					(name "Note") "FBV2-S2-001: **DEAD PAD - DNP, AND ONE TERMINAL IS DELIBERATELY UNCONNECTED (no-connect flagged).** This is a reserved 0603 rework pad next to the USB block: fitting the capacitor alone does nothing, because pin 1 goes to no net. It can only be pressed into service by cutting a trace and bridging to it at bring-up. It arrived from Beta-DM with no note, and is documented rather than deleted because the area cost is trivial - but it is a legitimate deletion candidate at PCB placement if the floorplan is tight. SEE THE FBV2-S2 SIMPLIFICATION SCAN.")
