					(name "Note2") "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71). Genuine onsemi BSS138LT1G is LCSC C82045, stock 762522. A loose search returns LRC LBSS138LT1G (C8490) instead - a different manufacturer. The genuine part is abundant, so there is no reason to accept the substitute. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee.")
				(field
					(name "LCSC") "C82045")
				(field
					(name "Note") "FBV2-S2-001: exact order code added - the schematic previously carried the generic type name 'BSS138' only, which D-096 does not accept as a selection. BSS138LT1G is the onsemi SOT-23 50 V / 220 mA logic-level N-channel MOSFET. It is a jellybean with many pin-compatible second sources in the same package, so substitution is a purchasing decision rather than a design change. CONFIRM THE LIVE LISTING AT BOM LOCK.")
				(field
