		(comp
			(ref "R44")
			(value "732k 1%")
			(footprint "Resistor_SMD:R_0603_1608Metric")
			(description "Resistor")
			(fields
				(field
					(name "Note2") "DNP BY DESIGN AND CORRECTLY SO - documented 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002). This part belongs to the NFC 5 V BOOST BRANCH: U13 TPS61023 + L2 1 uH + R44/R45 feedback divider + C34/C35 output, producing NFC_5V_PA_PENDING from BQ25185_SYS. The whole branch is DNP on the first build because D-055/D-056 select NFC_SUPPLY = +3V3 through R106 (FITTED), and R107 (DNP) is the mutually exclusive link that would select the 5 V branch instead. THE BRANCH IS PRESERVED, NOT ABANDONED: if bench measurement shows the 3.3 V field is short, fitting these six parts plus R107 and lifting R106 moves the PA to 5 V with no respin (D-049). NEVER FIT R106 AND R107 TOGETHER. Checked against the netlist at FBV2-S2-002; verified NOT to be an inherited Beta-DM oversight.")
				(field
					(name "Footprint") "Resistor_SMD:R_0603_1608Metric")
				(field
					(name "Datasheet")
				)
				(field
					(name "Description") "Resistor")
			)
			(libsource
				(lib "Device")
				(part "R")
				(description "Resistor")
			)
