				(value "SOURCING D-614. EXACT_PRIOR from the beta-dm audit line '100k' (ACCEPTED); manufacturer derived from the UNI-ROYAL(Uniroyal Elec) part-number family and corroborated by the audit text; identical specification.")
			)
