			(fields
				(field
					(name "Note2") "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71). Genuine onsemi NSR0240HT1G is LCSC C152519 but STOCK IS 7 against a need of 5 for the first five. A loose keyword search returns FUXINSEMI SD103AWS (C915626) instead - THAT IS A DIFFERENT PART AND MUST NOT BE ORDERED IN ITS PLACE. Buy from a broadline distributor and consign if LCSC stock has moved. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee.")
