			(fields
				(field
					(name "LCSC") "C25955556")
				(field
					(name "Note_Sourcing") "SOURCING D-615 LIVE_RECORD. The display FPC connector's LCSC code was the other half of DEVICE_SPEC s.16 item 8. JLCPCB record read 2026-09-05: HRS(Hirose) FH69-50S-0.5SH, LCSC C25955556, stock 790 against a first-five need of 5, 50 contacts, 0.5 mm, front insertion / back flip lock, double-sided top-and-bottom entry, 50 V 500 mA, -55..+125 C, surface mount right angle -- the genuine Hirose part D-206 confirmed JLC carries, so J1 stays MACHINE-PLACED. B-47's single-source finding stands.")
				(field
					(name "Manufacturer") "Hirose")
				(field
					(name "MPN") "FH69-50S-0.5SH")
				(field
					(name "Package") "Mates with Hirose FH69-50S-0.5SH (AQROOT_Beta:Hirose_FH69-50S-0.5SH, VERIFIED_VENDOR_EXACT). Mode 4-wire 8-bit SPI II, IM3:IM0 = 1110. Touch controller identity VERIFY: panel datasheet CST026 vs Adafruit FT6236/FT6236U. Panel FPC tail thickness VERIFY against Hirose 0.30 +/-0.05 mm.")
