				(field
					(name "Package") "20.0 x 14.0 x 3.0 mm castellated module, 22 pads, 1.27 mm pitch with a 5.57 mm gap at the IPEX end. DIO2 (8) strapped locally to TXEN (7) - firmware MUST enable SX1262 SetDIO2AsRfSwitchCtrl. RXEN (6) driven from SX1262_RXEN on the reclaimed U3.19 expander port with a 100k pulldown for a defined CLOSE state. Antenna: module IPEX/u.FL with Taoglas FXP890.07.0100C; pin 21 ANT stamp hole present but NOT routed - RF DO NOT ROUTE until final RF review. Procurement: Beta units must ship with the IPEX connector populated.")
