			(property
				(name "Package")
				(value "UFQFPN32 5x5x0.55, 0.5 mm pitch, 32 lands + exposed pad 33. LOCKED 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S1-004B): ST25R3916-AQET, NOT the B variant. Normal internal RF-regulator mode: VDD_IO on +3V3; VDD and VDD_TX both on NFC_SUPPLY, which is +3V3 on the first build through the R106 FIT link with the R107 DNP link as the no-respin 5 V fallback; I2C_EN grounded to select SPI; VDD_DR sourced from the VDD_RF regulated node - NOT tied to VDD_TX, which would be the regulator-bypass configuration and is not used. Regulator outputs VDD_D, VDD_A, VDD_RF and VDD_AM plus reference AGDC each carry ST-specified local decoupling. Exposed pad grounded per ST. FIRMWARE MUST SET sup3V. AAT_A/AAT_B, CSI/CSO, EXT_LM and MCU_CLK are explicit no-connects. RF front end and 27.12 MHz crystal are captured; every matching value is TUNE until STSW-ST25R004 is run.")
