				(field
					(name "Note_Sourcing") "SOURCING D-614. EXACT_PRIOR from the beta-dm audit line '4.7uF' (ACCEPTED); manufacturer derived from the Samsung Electro-Mechanics part-number family and corroborated by the audit text; identical specification.")
				(field
					(name "Note") "IR RECEIVER SUPPLY FILTER, shunt element. RETAINED at 4.7 uF after audit in FBV2-S1-007. With R21 100 R this gives a 339 Hz corner and 41 dB at the 38 kHz carrier, which is what keeps the transmitter out of the receiver front end - see the R21 note and datasheet Fig. 7. Do not reduce this value to save area without redoing that calculation.")
