					(name "LCSC") "C14663")
				(field
					(name "Note_Sourcing") "SOURCING D-614. EXACT_PRIOR from the beta-dm audit line '100nF X7R' (ACCEPTED); manufacturer derived from the YAGEO part-number family and corroborated by the audit text; dielectric X7R meets X7R.")
				(field
					(name "Note") "TCA4307 local decoupling, FBV2-S1-009. 100 nF X7R 0603 against pin 8 with the shortest possible return to pin 4. The part draws only 2.5 mA typical, but it switches rise-time accelerators that source 2-5 mA in tens of nanoseconds, and it is the device that has to behave correctly during a live insertion transient - which is exactly when the local rail is worst.")
