		(comp
			(ref "J5")
			(value "COMMUNITY_PORT_1x24")
			(footprint "AQROOT_Beta:Samtec_SSQ-124-02-G-S-RA")
			(datasheet "https://www.samtec.com/products/ssq-124-02-g-s-ra")
			(description "Samtec BCS-112-S-D-HE 2x12 24-contact 2.54 mm female horizontal pass-through socket strip")
			(fields
				(field
					(name "Note2") "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71). Samtec BCS-112-S-D-HE is LCSC C5575816 with STOCK 0 at $15.54. It is a 24-contact through-hole strip and was already MANUAL/SECONDARY ASSEMBLY by CTO ruling at FBV2-S1-009; buy direct from Samtec or a broadline distributor. The connector architecture is NOT compromised for SMT assembly. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee.")
				(field
					(name "LCSC") "C5575816")
				(field
					(name "Manufacturer") "Samtec")
				(field
					(name "MPN") "BCS-112-S-D-HE")
				(field
					(name "Alternate") "BCS-112-L-D-HE (10 uin gold, 100 mating cycles - plating-only alternate)")
				(field
					(name "Note") "AQROOT FBV2-S1-008... superseded; FBV2-S1-009 final lock. Samtec BCS-112-S-D-HE, verified live 2026-08-23 per D-096: ACTIVE, 385 pieces ship tomorrow, $7.314 @1 / $5.667 @100, UL E111594, RoHS, halogen free, MSL 1, probable COO Malaysia. 2 x 12 = 24 ACTIVE CONTACTS, .100 in / 2.54 mm pitch, FEMALE Tiger Claw dual-beam pass-through socket strip, HORIZONTAL (right-angle) entry, through-hole, 30 uin selective gold in the contact area. FOOTPRINT RE-VERIFIED AGAINST THE SAMTEC RECOMMENDED PCB LAYOUT DRAWING, REVISION B, FIG 3 (BCS-1XX-XXX-D-HE-XXX): 2.54 mm within a row, ROW-TO-ROW .310 +/-.002 in = 7.87 +/-0.05 mm, hole .028 in = 0.71 mm PTH, pin field 27.94 mm for 12 positions. NOT INTERCHANGEABLE with a vertical 2x12 pattern, whose rows are 2.54 mm apart. ODD = ROW A, EVEN = ROW B (D-084). EVERY POWER CONTACT IS VERTICALLY PAIRED WITH GND - 3/4, 9/10, 15/16, 21/22 - so a row-swap mis-insertion can only make a current-limited rail-to-ground short, never 5 V on a logic pin; ALL 3.3 V IS IN ROW A AND ALL 5 V IN ROW B. NO NC CONTACT, NO KEY CONTACT: the enclosure supplies polarisation and keying (D-097) with a >= 1.5 mm recess, an asymmetric upper rib and CLOSED ENDS that make a one-column offset mechanically impossible. Mates with any 0.64 mm square-post header whose mating post is 4.34-6.35 mm; reference TSW-112-07-L-D. BCS-112-L-D-HE is a plating-only cost-down alternate with an identical footprint but only 100 mating cycles against 2500 for -S (Samtec 187544 Rev 1), which is why -S is locked. THE HARWIN M20-7881242 IS REJECTED AS OBSOLETE AND MUST NEVER REAPPEAR (D-083 struck by D-093). ASSEMBLY: if the JLC service cannot place this through-hole part automatically, it is a MANUAL/SECONDARY assembly operation for the first five boards - the connector architecture is not compromised for SMT convenience.")
				(field
					(name "Footprint") "AQROOT_Beta:Samtec_SSQ-124-02-G-S-RA")
				(field
					(name "Datasheet") "https://www.samtec.com/products/ssq-124-02-g-s-ra")
				(field
					(name "Description") "Samtec BCS-112-S-D-HE 2x12 24-contact 2.54 mm female horizontal pass-through socket strip")
			)
			(libsource
				(lib "Connector_Generic")
				(part "Conn_02x12_Odd_Even")
				(description "Generic connector, double row, 02x12, odd/even pin numbering scheme (row 1 odd numbers, row 2 even numbers), script generated (kicad-library-utils/schlib/autogen/connector/)")
			)
			(property
				(name "Note2")
				(value "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71). Samtec BCS-112-S-D-HE is LCSC C5575816 with STOCK 0 at $15.54. It is a 24-contact through-hole strip and was already MANUAL/SECONDARY ASSEMBLY by CTO ruling at FBV2-S1-009; buy direct from Samtec or a broadline distributor. The connector architecture is NOT compromised for SMT assembly. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee.")
