				(value "0.1W")
			)
			(property
				(name "Note")
				(value "Native community pin series protection, D-090. 100 Ohm between the exposed contact and an ESP32-S3 GPIO. THESE TWO CONTACTS ARE THE ONLY ONES WITH A DIRECT PATH TO THE MCU, which is why they also carry a TPD4E1B06 channel. NEITHER IS A STRAPPING PIN - GPIO38 and GPIO47 - so no accessory can affect boot mode.")
			)
