					(name "LCSC") "C409779")
				(field
					(name "Note") "AQROOT FBV2-S1-008. Data sheet Issue LPDS-0001719 Rev.2, 2018-09-25. PIN 1 = COMMON ANODE, 2 = BLUE cathode, 3 = GREEN cathode, 4 = RED cathode - NOT the order used by Device:LED_ARGB (2=RK, 4=BK), which would swap red and blue. VF at 20 mA: R 1.7-2.3 V, G 2.7-3.3 V, B 2.7-3.4 V. IF continuous R 50 mA, G 30 mA, B 30 mA; IFP 100 mA at 1/10 duty. Iv at 20 mA: R 715-1420, G 1120-2250, B 285-715 mcd. Dominant wavelength R 622, G 515-530, B 460-470 nm. ESD HBM: RED 2000 V but GREEN and BLUE only 150 V - handling and assembly must treat this as an ESD-sensitive part. Tj -40 to +85 C, 2000 pcs/reel.")
			)
