				(field
					(name "Manufacturer") "Texas Instruments")
				(field
					(name "MPN") "TPD4E1B06DRLR")
				(field
					(name "Package") "SOT-563, TI DRL")
				(field
					(name "Note") "Four independent bidirectional ESD channels. Place on the connector side of the 100R series resistors. Route GND directly to board ground. Intended for XGPIO connector protection. Pin 5 has no internal connection, needs no routing, and is correctly left unconnected. The fourth device uses only three channels; the unused channel must be marked NC. No external rail capacitor or TVS parts are required. Pinout is the DRL / SOT-563 mapping from TI SLVSBQ8E Rev. E Table 4-1; the DCK package uses different pin numbering and must not be substituted.")
			)
